### Get all blogs
GET http://localhost:3003/api/blogs

### Create new blog
POST http://localhost:3003/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "seventh",
  "author": "mustafa",
  "url": "example-blog.com",
  "likes": 5,
  "user": "699a0d61b23ba89ed557379f"
}

### Delete blog
DELETE http://localhost:3003/api/blogs/6992fd67b138c70af739f42a

### Update blog
PUT http://localhost:3003/api/blogs/69871141ab3154cfb07a9c6f
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "sixth",
    "author": "mustafa",
    "url": "example-blog.com",
    "likes": 40,
    "id": "69871141ab3154cfb07a9c6f"
}